# --- Local `npm run dev` (Vite on :5173) ---
# Leave VITE_API_BASE_URL unset so the app uses same-origin relative URLs
# (`/api/pipeline`). Vite proxies `/api` and `/specializations` to the backend.
#
# Default proxy target is http://127.0.0.1:8010 (see vite.config.ts).
# If uvicorn uses another port, copy this file to `.env.development` and set:
# VITE_DEV_API_PROXY=http://127.0.0.1:YOUR_PORT

# --- Production / cross-origin build ---
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com
# (no trailing slash; omit entirely when UI and API share one origin)
